{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-10. It distinguishes four outcomes: key absent -> missing/null, explicit null -> null/null, exact int 6..15 -> integer/original, else -> invalid/null. Uses membership check before inspecting the value so missing and null are separate. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions, no imports/I/O/host calls. Module-level result assignment. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-10", "description": "Classify raw ttl: key absent -> {kind:"missing",ttl:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",ttl:null}; exact integer 6..15 -> {kind:"integer",ttl:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",ttl:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. No imports/I/O/host calls. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 remain prerequisites.", "content": "if 'ttl' not in inputs:
    result = {'kind': 'missing', 'ttl': None}
elif inputs['ttl'] is None:
    result = {'kind': 'null', 'ttl': None}
elif type(inputs['ttl']) is int and 6 <= inputs['ttl'] <= 15:
    result = {'kind': 'integer', 'ttl': inputs['ttl']}
else:
    result = {'kind': 'invalid', 'ttl': None}"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
